62577093057","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5454,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":83,"retweet_count":0},"text":"他实现了我从小就有的梦想。 https://t.co/z1RQn5gfgC","url":"https://x.com/xiaojingcanxue/status/2113072362577093057"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:55:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113071677672227009"],"id":"2113071677672227009","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":11666,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#早间市场快报 &gt; https://t.co/gbA3Taskur\n- 美股走高，SpaceX大涨\n- AI发现重大安全漏洞，全球七成网站或面临风险\n- 谷歌前CEO：中国在AI竞赛中落后美国半年，为何这已是胜势\n- 中国AI工具与日本境内黑客攻击事件有关\n- 丰田最畅销SUV为何突然一车难求\n- 马斯克限速星链如何打乱乌克兰防御部署 https://t.co/UuIbxLzj7Y","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2113071677672227009"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:54:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113071446528266592"],"id":"2113071446528266592","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":73,"impression_count":346478,"like_count":101,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":104,"retweet_count":2},"text":"曝个大瓜🍉\n\n要不是私生活太混乱，她现在咖位不输杨幂、白鹿、高圆圆\n\n一张标准女星脸，演技也过得去，本来是能靠实力吃饭的。\n\n她偏不，非要去给有钱人当金丝雀。\n\n先跟王思聪撕得满城风雨，转头又跟了“沪上皇”秦奋，还被拍了不少不雅照。\n\n圈里人送外号“女海王”，四角恋玩得明明白白，喜欢搞别人老公","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2113071446528266592"},{"author_id":"44186175","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:48:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113069840223310311"],"id":"2113069840223310311","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":8549,"like_count":120,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":12},"text":"在美国提议下，乌克兰停止轰炸俄罗斯炼油厂三天，但俄罗斯并没有停止轰炸乌克兰的基础设施和平民，且在哈尔科夫发生了俄罗斯无人机袭击公园里推着婴儿车的母亲的惨案。\n\n请注意，是无人机袭击，人操控的，不是不长眼睛的导弹。\n\n🇸🇪 https://t.co/bQpHMABbYI","url":"https://x.com/xiaojingcanxue/status/2113069840223310311"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:47:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113069735260688703"],"id":"2113069735260688703","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":24,"impression_count":11518,"like_count":25,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":1},"text":"现在 AI 制作语音书效果还可以，但我觉得还不如专业的真人朗读的，另外还会有多音字错误，反而误导小朋友。所以有高质量真人的语音书还是选择真人的。\n\n如果真要自己用 AI 做语音书的话，最好先用大语言模型过一遍发音，让 Agent 去操作 https://t.co/SAntkYrn3d","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2113069735260688703"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:47:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113069652393771172"],"id":"2113069652393771172","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4049,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"快讯：\n\n唐禹哲逃兵役被判了：1年7个月缓刑3年，罚约6.2万人民币，还要干150小时义务劳务。\n\n曾出演《铠甲勇士》《终极一班》\n\n男神滤镜碎了，账还是算清楚了\n\n只是很想知道，这个判刑的艺人，算不算劣质艺人？出来以后还能不能混娱乐圈？","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2113069652393771172"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:47:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113069596055834945"],"id":"2113069596055834945","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":26950,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"文莱外交部长阿都马丁王子首次以外长身份正式访问新加坡，星期三同国务资政李显龙会面并共进午餐。李资政说，随着新加坡与文莱的新一代领导人肩负更大责任，他很欣慰看到两国持续深化紧密关系。 https://t.co/yeETTvsrA6","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2113069596055834945"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:45:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113069084917309878"],"id":"2113069084917309878","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":16562,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"川普老年痴呆越来越严重了，连他念念不忘的诺贝尔和平奖叫什么名字都忘了。川普在南卡拉票：“他们颁发了那个了不起的和平奖，对吧？有人知道那个和平奖叫什么名字吗？他们把普利策奖颁给了一位年轻女士。”","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2113069084917309878"},{"author_id":"121908437","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:44:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113068990792904977"],"id":"2113068990792904977","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":39624,"like_count":116,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":114,"retweet_count":3},"text":"这一天终于来了：我的 Claude 账号刚刚被封了。由于我早就做好了心理准备，所以情绪很平稳，就是不知道能不能给我退款。 https://t.co/9y0uXx2zF8","url":"https://x.com/tualatrix/status/2113068990792904977"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:40:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113067847429632059"],"id":"2113067847429632059","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":10687,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":1},"text":"再补充一个 Claude Code 任务卡片的细节，有些任务可以让它去云端执行，前提是你的项目是提交到 GitHub，然后通过 GitHub 的 connector 已经连接上了。\n\n走云端的好处是多任务并行起来会更容易，不过不如本地环境上工具丰富。 https://t.co/9YP9EycvH0 https://t.co/6OUyNjcG0F","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2113067847429632059"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113067813510255019"],"id":"2113067813510255019","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":53138,"like_count":176,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":19},"text":"10月21日，广东汕头市金平区，疑因欠薪纠纷，多人攀爬至当地政府周边的一处楼顶边缘维权。 https://t.co/dNisDyEEBC","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113067813510255019"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:38:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113067412979433847"],"id":"2113067412979433847","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":222,"impression_count":55840,"like_count":239,"quote_count":13,"reply_count":57,"retweet_count":44},"text":"用 Node.js 的要升级了：三条版本线都有高危漏洞，最严重的可远程执行代码，eMudhra 那 8 枚坏证书也一并拉黑\n\n用 Node.js 跑服务、写工具的开发者，这周要换版本了。10 月 21 日，Node.js 给还在维护的三条版本线发了安全更新：22.x 升到 v22.23.4，24.x 升到 v24.22.1，26.x 升到 https://t.co/1YD9UK3LSF","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2113067412979433847"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113067186806022518"],"id":"2113067186806022518","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":20334,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":9},"text":"消失几年的赵薇突然露脸，\n镜头一怼上去，小燕子玩